# ---- Python (GitHub's Python.gitignore template) ----
# The template's `lib/`, `lib64/` and `var/` entries are left out on purpose: they would also match
# system_files/usr/lib and any system_files/var path, and new files there could not be added.

# Byte-compiled / optimized / DLL files
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*$py.class

# C extensions
*.so

